# Secrets — never commit.
# Patterns are deliberately broad: a copy saved as `env` or `.env.local` holds
# exactly the same live keys as `.env`, and only the exact name was matched
# before, so such a copy was staged for a public push.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
env
env.*
*.env
secrets/
*-sa.json
*service-account*.json

